{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1424081-voting-with-my-wallet","id":1424081,"title":"Voting with my Wallet","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-11-15T13:06:49-08:00","id":1424081,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon13.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Voting with my Wallet","content":"I remember coming across the game Vampire the Masquerade back in the early 90s. My local game store was proud of the fact they were carrying it. And more than happy to sell it along with the 10-sided dice needed to play it. I remember the hours of photocopying blank sheets and building characters with the system to run it with my friends. Back then it was a lot of fun. <br /> <br /> Over the years things evolve as they do and Exalted came out. I remember this system for being over the top from the start. Amazing anime style artwork pulled me in. It was a wonderful product and I was excited to share it with my friends and run it for them. I even ran it at local anime conventions to get it more exposure and it was rather successful. Everything was fine until I started asking for support from this company. Getting clarification on rules with D&amp;D 5e is so simple. Jeremy Crawford is more than happy to reply with official answers to clarify damn near anything anyone asks... but this writing team for Exalted? That's a different story. This online community has been the most toxic experience I have ever had with a company. Moderators banning people for two years at times for asking for rules clarifications, and in general, toxic people replying to threads when official clarification was asked for, not community clarification. I appreciate the offers of opinions but I came here with one purpose, official clarification. What I found was a toxic community with trigger happy moderators willing to ban people at the drop of a hat. Wonderful community you folks run. Over the last two years I have not purchased a single product from White Wolf Game Studio, Paradox Interactive, or Onyx Path Publishing. I wanted to express my thanks to this community for making me feel like asking for clarification on anything is just cause for banning someone. The toxicity of this forum has made me sell off all my old White Wolf products. Thank you for that. I am now making my final post on this forum to say that it's been a fun ride but at this juncture in my life, I don't need the toxicity of this online forum or the fan base of these game products and so I have made the choice to<b> vote with my wallet</b>. Never again will this company see a single dime from me or my friends. We're through with the toxicity on this forum and the people who play these game systems. Over many years we've seen people play these products and how cliquish they are. We've seen that this toxic culture is not just part of the forums but part of the product itself and all those who play it. Thank you for making this choice so easy for me. My vote to walk away from this company's product lines and never again support them was the easiest vote I've ever made. And it's all thanks to those of you reading this right now. I could have just never come back and said a thing, but no, I wanted one final post just to make sure you all understood my new stance. After all, it would not have been this way had you all just been nicer to your customer base. Goodbye forever White Wolf Game Studio.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6162-raven79","name":"Raven79","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6162_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T14:48:44-08:00","id":1424100,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">My sincerest apologies.<br /> Your ban was intended to be permanent and it was for </span><u><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1129664-reforging-the-jade-prison?p=1131967#post1131967\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">this</span></a></u><span style=\"color:#B22222\"> post and follow-up private messages that aligned with your prior negative behaviour and disrespect to other members of this forum such as for example, going into the headcanon thread to yell at people for not following canon. It was not pertaining to any questions you were asking, sorry if that was unclear on your end we have to assume the forum software is doing its job and sometimes there's a little confusion with end users.<br /> <br /> Anyway, with that situation rectified sorry it didn't work out and have fun in pastures new. </span></b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}